fx_points.description:
FX forward points in price units of the pair (forward = spot + points;
e.g. 0.0025 for 25 pips on EUR/USD). Exactly one of fx_points or
quote_id must be present. May be negative.

flat_hazard_rate.description:
OR: use flat hazard rate. Optional; presence-driven. Present -> use it;
absent with quotes -> bootstrap from quotes; absent with no quotes is an
error (no invented default hazard rate).

upfront.description:
Upfront payment. Optional: presence selects the upfront-bearing
CreditDefaultSwap constructor (a genuine 0 upfront is representable);
absent selects the plain no-upfront constructor.

autocall_trigger.description:
Autocall trigger as a fraction of the initial level (1.0 = 100%);
perf >= trigger ends the note. Absent = the note cannot be called at
this date.
